vuelta — checks and safely updates dependencies

Examples:
  vuelta scan
  vuelta scan --all --json
  vuelta project add . --name api

Everyday commands:
  scan         find vulnerabilities and package candidates; create snapshots only for safely mutable manifests
  update       apply exactly one validated update snapshot

Configuration:
  project      list or add configured projects
  config       create or validate configuration
  environment  trust local Docker environments

Help:
  help         show top-level or command-specific help

Global options:
  -c, --config PATH          use only this machine or project config
  --no-input                 disable prompts; does not confirm changes
  --no-color                 disable color and terminal formatting
  -h, --help                 show help and exit
  --version                  show version and exit

Run 'vuelta help <command>' for command details.
Run 'vuelta help --all' to include CI and server commands.
